BaseConfigLib::initializeTokenOut
├── given zero entries
│   └── it should return remaining data unchanged
├── given single entry
│   ├── it should add token to storage set for chainId
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
├── given multiple entries same chain
│   ├── it should add all tokens to same chainId set
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
├── given multiple entries different chains
│   ├── it should add tokens to respective chainId sets
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
└── given extra data after entries
    └── it should return extra data as remaining